# tomb_1_hall_stairs_grunt_patterns is a source-authored tomb_1_hall_stairs map. Its MAP is unchanged; named Lua hooks replace source script lines at their original positions.
NAME:    tomb_1_hall_stairs_grunt_patterns
TAGS:    tomb_1_hall_stairs unrand
SHUFFLE: PR
SHUFFLE: ABCD / ACBD / ACDB / CABD / CADB / CDAB
SHUFFLE: EFGH / EGFH / EGHF / GEFH / GEHF / GHEF
SUBST:   ABEF = c, CDGH = .
NSUBST:  P = P / Q / ., R = R / .
: vault.run("shared.hall_setup")
SUBST:   - = .
MAP
..                                   ..
..c...D....c-P           R-c....G...c..
..c...D....c--           --c....G...c..
cc+........+cc           cc+........+cc
......A.......           .......E......
.....1A1......           ......1E1.....
CC..BB2BB...CC           HH...FF2FF..HH
.....1A1......           ......1E1.....
......A.......           .......E......
cc+........+cc           cc+........+cc
--c...D....c--           --c....G...c--
P-c...D....c-P           R-c....G...c-R
ENDMAP
